title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathfrak M,L\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathfrak M,L\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb P\\in M\\)</span> (ground-model carrier, its structure code, language, and forcing set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundingPosetData}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundingPosetData}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathrm{ZFC},L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathrm{ZFC},L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (ZFC axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (forcing relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundingPosetData}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathfrak M,L)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathrm{ZFC},L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\left(\np\\Vdash_{M,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\n\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\leq m\\to f(m)\\leq g(m))\n\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}poset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundingPosetData}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathfrak M,L)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathrm{ZFC},L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\left(\np\\Vdash_{M,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\n\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\leq m\\to f(m)\\leq g(m))\n\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}poset\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundingPoset}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak M,L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BoundingPosetData}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathfrak M,L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}poset\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundingPoset}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak M,L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BoundingPosetData}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathfrak M,L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ground model satisfaction is carried by the explicit structure code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>; the forcing relation continues to use its transitive carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and now displays the selected order.  The three-place predicate existentially projects the structure witnesses without overloading its arity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md